 Kingdom United States of America West Indies","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"Imperial-wide; same snippet as imperial-msc-computing."}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '2026-11-27'::date),
  ('usf-ms-artificial-intelligence', 'usf', 'Master of Science in Artificial Intelligence', 'US', 'MS', 'ds', 'https://www.usf.edu/ai-cybersecurity-computing/academics/graduate/msai.aspx', 'active', 'direct', '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"Fall or Spring","source_url":"https://www.usf.edu/ai-cybersecurity-computing/academics/graduate/prospective-students.aspx","evidence_snippet":"We offer fall and spring admissions for all of our MSc and PhD degrees.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"Bellini College prospective students page; applies to all its MS degrees including the MSAI."}'::jsonb, '{"value":"2027-06-01","source_url":"https://www.usf.edu/ai-cybersecurity-computing/academics/graduate/prospective-students.aspx","evidence_snippet":"MS and PhD priority deadlines: Fall: January 15 Spring: September 1 Please see the Office of Admission website for the final university deadlines. MS final university deadlines: Fall: June 1","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","basis":"inferred","note":"Final deadline for Fall 2027. Applications by the priority deadline (15 January 2027) receive maximum consideration; later ones are considered on a space-available basis.","review_note":"Page gives no year; 2027-06-01 is the next Fall MS final deadline. Same approach as usf-mscs in the seed."}'::jsonb, '{"value":{"scale":"cgpa_4","min":3,"text":"“B” average (3.00 on a 4.00 scale) or better in all work attempted while registered as an undergraduate student working toward a bachelor’s degree"},"source_url":"https://www.usf.edu/admissions/international/admission-information/graduate/academic-requirements.aspx","evidence_snippet":"“B” average (3.00 on a 4.00 scale) or better in all work attempted while registered as an undergraduate student working toward a bachelor’s degree","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"USF university-wide international graduate minimum; programs may add requirements."}'::jsonb, '{"value":{"ielts_ove