ate/prospective-students.aspx","evidence_snippet":"Unofficial Transcripts (including the grade sheet and diploma, if applicable) PDF of GRE Scores (for Master''s applicants except MSAI) Resume","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":"GRE not required for the MSAI.","source_url":"https://www.usf.edu/ai-cybersecurity-computing/academics/graduate/msai.aspx","evidence_snippet":"The Master of Science in Artificial Intelligence is available in both in-person and online formats. The GRE is not required.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"Designed for students with and without an undergraduate degree in computer science or computer engineering; those without a CS background start with three essentials courses and a Mathematics for AI course.","source_url":"https://www.usf.edu/ai-cybersecurity-computing/academics/graduate/msai.aspx","evidence_snippet":"Designed for students with and without an undergraduate degree in computer science or computer engineering","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"Same page: ''For those without CS background, it begins with three two-credit essentials courses and a Mathematics for AI course.'' Offered in-person and online."}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '2026-11-27'::date),
  ('cmu-mse', 'cmu', 'Master of Software Engineering', 'US', 'MSE', 'se', 'https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/index.html', 'active', 'direct', '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"Fall 2027","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"Fall 2027 Program Start: MSE applications open on Wednesday, September 9, 2026 and close on Wednesday, December 9, 2026.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"From the ''MSE Campus Programs (One admissions cycle per year)'' block of the How to Apply page."}'::jsonb, '{"value":"2026-12-09","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"Application Deadline December 9, 2026 (3pm EST)","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","note":"Deadline is 3pm US Eastern time. An online coding assessment follows (invitations 11 December, due 17 December 2026).","review_note":"Admissions Timeline on the MSE How to Apply page for the Fall 2027 campus MSE / MSE-Applied Study. Same page: ''Coding Assessment Deadline December 17, 2026''."}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":{"amount":27000,"currency":"USD","period":"semester"},"source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/tuition.html","evidence_snippet":"2026-27 MSE MSE-SS & MSE-ES MSE Online MSE Graduate Certificates Program Length 4 semesters 4 semesters 6-8 semesters 2 semesters Total Units 198 153 108 24 Tuition per Semester $27,000","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","note":"This is the 2026-27 rate for the MSE (the page has no 2027-28 rate yet). The MSE runs 4 semesters. Health insurance, technology and other fees are extra.","review_note":"First column of the 2026-27 table = MSE. CMU charges the same tuition to US and international students. 2025-26 was $26,250."}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":16,"source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/index.html","evidence_snippet":"The program is an on-campus, 16 or 20-month long program when pursued full-time.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","note":"16 months for the MSE; 20 months for the MSE - Applied Study (with internship).","review_note":"Home page table also lists ''Master of Software Engineering Full-Time Yes 16 months''."}'::jsonb, '{"value":"James E. Tomayko Scholarship for one or more students with academic excellence, leadership and financial need; usually identified after the first semester in the program.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/tuition.html","evidence_snippet":"The James E. Tomayko Scholarship is awarded to one or more students who demonstrate academic excellence, leadership potential, strong communication skills, exceptional personal initiative, and demonstrated financial need. Prospective awardees are generally identified upon the completion of one full semester in the program, with recipients chosen by committee.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":"Statement of Purpose written by you, with specific details about your professional goals and your software engineering experience on teams and projects. A video essay is also required.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"Statement of Purpose: Your statement should be written by you and include specific details about your professional goals and about your software engineering experience on teams and projects.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"Same page: ''Video Essay: The guidelines for the video essay will be available in the application.''"}'::jsonb, '{"value":3,"source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"Letters of Recommendation: At least three letters of recommendation should be submitted on your behalf from academic and/or industry personnel who have worked closely with you recently.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":"A resume/CV is required with the application.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"The following materials are required with your application: Statement of Purpose: Your statement should be written by you and include specific details about your professional goals and about your software engineering experience on teams and projects. Resume/CV","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":"GRE optional: an application without GRE scores is not at a disadvantage. An online coding assessment is required after the deadline.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"Unofficial GRE Scores (optional): GRE scores are optional. An application without GRE scores is not at a disadvantage; however, applicants who have taken the GREs are encouraged to submit their scores.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"Same page: ''Online Coding Assessment: Invitations will be sent out two days after the application deadline.''"}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"Needs an undergraduate degree (preferably Computer Science or engineering-related) and a cumulative QPA higher than 2.5. Professional software engineering experience is recommended, not required.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"An undergraduate degree, preferably in Computer Science or other scientific or other engineering-related discipline. Cumulative QPA higher than 2.5. Professional software engineering experience is recommended, but not a requirement.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"QPA 2.5 was NOT put in min_gpa_rule because the page does not name the scale (CMU''s QPA is on 4.0, but the page does not say so)."}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"No waiver: CMU does not waive the English test for non-native speakers on an F-1/J-1 visa, including for study in English outside the US. A TOEFL (preferred), IELTS or Duolingo score is required.","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"We also do not issue waivers based on previous study at an English-language high school, college, or university outside of the United States. No amount of educational experience in English, regardless of which country it occurred in, will result in a test waiver.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","review_note":"The page names no minimum TOEFL/IELTS/Duolingo score, so language_req was left empty."}'::jsonb, '{"value":"mse-applications@andrew.cmu.edu","source_url":"https://mse.s3d.cmu.edu/applicants/mse-as/apply.html","evidence_snippet":"If you submitted an application but do not receive a coding invitation on December 11th, please contact mse-applications@andrew.cmu.edu as soon as possible.","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '2026-11-27'::date),
  ('imperial-msc-computing-se', 'imperial', 'Computing (Software Engineering) MSc', 'UK', 'MSc', 'se', 'https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/courses/postgraduate-taught/computing-software-engineering-msc/', 'active', 'direct', '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"October 2027","source_url":"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/courses/postgraduate-taught/computing-software-engineering-msc/","evidence_snippet":"Duration 1 year Start date October 2027","fetched_at":"2026-11-27"}'::jsonb, '{"value":"2027-01-06","source_url":"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/courses/postgraduate-taught/computing-software-engineering-msc/","evidence_snippet":"Round 2 Applications open on Wednesday 30 September 2026 Applications close on Wednesday 6 January 2027 Decision by Wednesday 3 March 2027","fetched_at":"2026-11-27","note":"Imperial admits in rounds (23.59 UK time on the closing date). This is the round open now; Round 3 closes 10 March 2027 and Round 4 closes 28 April 2027, but places in later rounds are not guaranteed.","review_note":"Same page: ''Round 3 ... Applications close on Wednesday 10 March 2027'' and ''Round 4 ... Applications close on Wednesday 28 April 2027''; ''we cannot guarantee that places will be available, or that courses will remain open, in later rounds.'' Chosen the currently open round. NOTE: imperial-msc-computing deliberately keeps its deadline null for a demo; drop this deadline if that demo should also cover this course."}'::jsonb, '{"value":{"scale":"percent","min":75,"text":"Imperial''s general minimum for Pakistani applicants: a four-year HEC-funded Bachelor''s (awarded 2016 or later) with a final overall mark of 75% or better. This course asks for a First-Class degree, and selectors may demand a higher mark."},"source_url":"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/study/apply/postgraduate-taught/entry-requirements/accepted-qualifications/","evidence_snippet":"To be considered for admission to postgraduate study, a